{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1717200000, "end_date": 1717804799, "month_true_total": 346, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:55:09 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "166894967", "author": {"steamid": "76561199486024802", "personaname": "BusySIXString", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199486024802/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 8827, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1802, "last_played": 1785647829, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "best online co op game ive played in years", "timestamp_created": 1717801405, "timestamp_updated": 1717801405, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166894037", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095297942", "personaname": "Jin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095297942/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 3033, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3033, "last_played": 1717615085, "avatar": "752eb38c3b0bc6f74708ec2c3d44d00bda41edde"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dark Soul with guns and A LOT of rings.", "timestamp_created": 1717800174, "timestamp_updated": 1717800174, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.626013994216918945", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166893580", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994890330", "personaname": "DropKickFinale", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994890330/", "num_games_owned": 1465, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4968, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2624, "last_played": 1741050079, "avatar": "775afbe7d756ad959eac545c3a4ef58974fd6043"}, "language": "english", "review": "Late to the party, love the game dearly though.\r\n\r\nThis is a lovingly crafted set of worlds in a story that embraces the idea of change and rebirth in a way that feels organic and real. Every adventure is different, the worlds and stories interchange and weave together as you hear about previous exploits you took part in from NPCs in entirely different time periods. Stepping foot into a new world genuinely feels as exciting on the 40th hour as it does the first, because even though you recognize the name of the realm, the story you hear will be new, the dungeons will have fresh puzzles, and the enemies are placed at different turns. \r\n\r\nThis... Is procedural gameplay done right.\r\n\r\nYou will always feel like an explorer, always feel like you have choices to make, and always stumble on new items and weapons that make you rethink your build, and want to try something new.\r\n\r\nMy only gripes are:\r\n\r\nThree player limit cap sucks, design it for three, but allow people to have more, just warn them it's not going to be the same.\r\n\r\nDLC items are annoying if you don't have the DLC. If one player doesn't have DLC, they'll get items they cannot use, sometimes excessively. A solution should be found for this, either scrap compensation or different item rolls, but something.", "timestamp_created": 1717799600, "timestamp_updated": 1717799600, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_ea